Role Description This is a full-time, on-site PLC-Automation Engineer position based in Pune City. The role involves designing, programming, and commissioning automation solutions using CODESYS, TwinCAT, and Siemens TIA Portal/Schneider platforms for industrial and process control applications. Day-to-day responsibilities include developing PLC logic, HMI/SCADA configurations, testing and debugging control programs, and ensuring seamless integration with electrical and mechanical systems. The engineer will collaborate with cross-functional teams to gather requirements, create technical documentation, and support installation, start-up, and optimization of automated systems at customer sites. The role also includes diagnosing issues, performing root-cause analysis, implementing corrective actions, and maintaining compliance with relevant safety and industry standards. 

