&nbsp; 

- Independently own and deliver complex DevOps and Platform Engineering work. &nbsp; 

- Design and implement advanced CI/CD and GitOps workflows using established enterprise standards. &nbsp; 

- Build and enhance reusable Terraform/OpenTofu modules, automation, and platform tooling. &nbsp; 

- Implement and troubleshoot complex AWS and Kubernetes/EKS platform solutions. &nbsp; 

